---
interface Props {
  headingTag?: keyof astroHTML.JSX.IntrinsicElements;
}
const { headingTag = "h2" } = Astro.props;
const Heading = headingTag;
---
<section class="section_cta">
  <div class="padding-global is-cta">
    <div class="cta-wrap">
      <div data-reveal="scale" class="container-large">
        <div class="cta_top">
          <div class="cta_text">
            <div class="text-color-on-primary">Mais de 8 segmentos atendidos</div>
          </div>
          <div class="avatars-wrap">
            <div class="avatar-item is-first"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/hero-icon-one_1hero-icon-one.webp" alt="" class="img"></div>
            <div class="avatar-item is-second"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/section-1_1section-1.webp 500w, /images/section-1_1section-1.webp 800w, /images/section-1_1section-1.webp 1080w, /images/section-1_1section-1.webp 1128w" alt="" src="/images/section-1_1section-1.webp" loading="lazy" class="img"></div>
            <div class="avatar-item is-third"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/hero-icon-three_1hero-icon-three.webp" alt="" class="img"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="spacer-huge"></div>
        <Heading class="text-color-on-primary">Pronto para transformar <br>seu negócio com IA?</Heading>
        <div class="spacer-medium"></div>
        <div class="max-width-medium is-33rem">
          <div class="text-color-on-primary">Nossa equipe conecta estratégia e tecnologia avançada de IA para ajudar empresas a otimizar processos, melhorar decisões e criar experiências digitais inteligentes.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="spacer-huge"></div>
        <div class="button_wrapper">
          <a href="/contact" class="button-arrow w-inline-block">
            <div class="button-arrow_wrap">
              <div class="button-arrow_text">
                <div class="text_button">Falar com especialista</div>
              </div>
              <div class="button_container-arrow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewbox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="icon-1x1-main">
                  <path d="M13.0457 8.13128L5.8733 15.3037L4.69479 14.1252L11.8672 6.95277L5.54568 6.95277L5.54568 5.28636H14.7121V14.4528L13.0457 14.4528V8.13128Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                </svg></div>
              <div class="button-arrow_bg"></div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="overlay"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
